OL,3,GNEWSABattery disposal plea after fires
OL,4,Aat waste sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to dispose of
OL,7,Fbatteries and electrical items
OL,8,Fresponsibly after a series of fires at
OL,9,Fwaste dumps in the past year.
OL,11,FKent Fire and Rescue Service (KFRS) is
OL,12,Fcampaigning to raise awareness of how
OL,13,Fto dispose of batteries and
OL,14,Frechargeable electrical items to reduce
OL,15,Fthe risk of a fire.
OL,17,FFirefighters said battery-related fires
OL,18,Fwere often caused by items such as
OL,19,Felectric toothbrushes and razors, vapes
OL,20,Fand household batteries being disposed
OL,21,Fof incorrectly.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
