OL,3,GNEWSABattery disposal plea after fires
OL,4,Aat waste sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent councillor Jamie Henderson said
OL,7,Fbatteries and small electricals that
OL,8,Fwere not disposed of correctly had
OL,9,Fcaused 22 fires at Kent's waste and
OL,10,Frecycling facilities and 139 at the
OL,11,FAllington Energy from Waste plant.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
